+        // and are ready join the ticket, which pops whole (Matchmake waits for it). Then, without the lock (a
+        // login, a logout and the bot factory call back into BossFights::Forget and the map code), the world
+        // thread does what was asked (RunBotJobs): picks a kept bot of that role, class and faction or makes one,
+        // puts it at the hangout, logs it in; gets a bot that came ready; logs bots out. The maps don't update
+        // meanwhile (World::Update runs this before sMapMgr.Update).
+
+        struct BotJob
